      "mutation_intent": "Maintain a scenario where ego drives toward a signalized junction with multiple active traffic lights, preserving the conditions for a red-light violation without enforcing or clarifying lane invasion or exact stop-line behavior. Small spatial and weather adjustments keep module behaviors and route–light relation effectively unknown while ensuring traffic light activity and planning/vehicle_status continuity.",
      "expected_oracle": "red_light",
